From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 13 Sep 2026 07:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sysbus: allow the HFP AG to reach telephony

The hands-free audio gateway subscribes to five telephony queries in
src/AG/hfpagsubscribe.h:

  luna://com.palm.telephony/callStateQuery
  luna://com.palm.telephony/signalStrengthQuery
  luna://com.palm.telephony/networkStatusQuery
  luna://com.palm.telephony/isNetworkRoaming
  luna://com.palm.telephony/phoneNumberQuery

but its role only permits outbound to bluetooth2, account and audio, so
ls-hubd refuses the name query before ACGs are ever consulted and no call
state ever reaches the gateway.

com.webos.service.telephony is the name webos-telephonyd registers;
GetServiceRedirectionVariants() in the hub maps com.palm.telephony onto
it, so one entry covers both spellings.

Note that signalStrengthQuery and networkStatusQuery are the only two of
the five that webos-telephonyd currently implements; the other three are
a separate gap and are not addressed here.
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
---
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 files/sysbus/com.webos.service.hfp.role.json.in  | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(s), 1 deletion(s)

--- a/files/sysbus/com.webos.service.hfp.role.json.in
+++ b/files/sysbus/com.webos.service.hfp.role.json.in
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@
         {
             "service":"com.webos.service.hfp",
             "inbound":["*"],
-            "outbound":["com.webos.service.bluetooth2","com.webos.service.account", "com.webos.service.audio"]
+            "outbound":["com.webos.service.bluetooth2","com.webos.service.account", "com.webos.service.audio", "com.webos.service.telephony"]
         }
     ]
 }
